https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198044516592/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 37403, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15103, "last_played": 1678685887, "avatar": "c41b72451233cf56b937b659bbea125e6fd2b021"}, "language": "english", "review": "I really want to give this game a thumbs up. The multiplayer alone gives it so much potential. Unfortunately it is riddled with game breaking bugs even in the vanilla mode. Graphical glitches that cause the AI in the game to be in a different location than they really are. Collision boxes set so you can't shoot through a leaf, or a small pebble rips apart your tank when you roll over it.\n\nThe simple fact that the game is so modifiable is the only saving factor it has going for it.\n\nIf you choose to buy it, make sure you are drunk or high so the bugs are humorous and not frustrating.\n\nI've never experienced such lazy developers before that care so little about their product.", "timestamp_created": 1491596723, "timestamp_updated": 1491596723, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519842445850372314", "comment_count": 4, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}]}